deepin-terminal-ghostty (0.6.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Replace coding agent icons with lobehub avatar webp versions and apply
    circle mask with antialiasing for badge display in the vertical sidebar.
  * Reduce vertical sidebar tab and pane heights to match the horizontal
    DTabBar, making the sidebar more compact.
  * Show exit confirmation dialog when closing a tab or window that has
    running child processes, with text distinguishing single vs multiple
    processes and tab vs window scenarios.

 -- Deepin Packages <packages@deepin.org>  Sun, 26 Apr 2026 23:00:00 +0800

deepin-terminal-ghostty (0.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add terminal color scheme support with built-in dark, light, and custom
    theme JSON files. Theme can be switched from the context menu or
    titlebar menu, or set to follow the system color scheme automatically.
  * Synchronize sidebar styling with DTK palette so the vertical tab bar
    matches the horizontal DTabBar across light, dark, and custom themes.
  * Add Theme submenu to both the terminal context menu and titlebar menu,
    with Light / Dark / System options and translations in zh_CN and es.
  * Reorder titlebar menu entries and add About and Exit from DTK defaults.
  * Fix terminal content disappearing and flickering during window resize
    by forcing a full redraw when the back buffer is recreated.
  * Fix split pane terminals rendering with default colors instead of the
    active theme by applying theme in TermPane::createTerminal().
  * Fix invisible splitter handles and sidebar section borders caused by
    DTK palette integration overriding default style colors.
  * Disable DTK built-in switch-theme menu to avoid duplication with the
    new Theme submenu.

 -- Deepin Packages <packages@deepin.org>  Sun, 26 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0800

deepin-terminal-ghostty (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add shell integration that reports running commands via OSC sequences and
    displays process-specific icons in the vertical tab sidebar.
  * Support X10/SGR/UTF-8/URxVT mouse tracking with scroll events.
  * Add startup command execution options (--command, --working-directory).
  * Install desktop file and application icon.
  * Fix CJK character stretching distortion and supplementary-plane rendering.
  * Fix transient terminal resizes that dropped visible pane content.
  * Fix text selection when dragging from bottom-right to top-left.
  * Preserve split pane layout when closing individual terminals.
  * Add app-configured terminal content padding.
  * Add CI static analysis workflow and esctest smoke coverage.

 -- Deepin Packages <packages@deepin.org>  Sat, 26 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0800

deepin-terminal-ghostty (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Fix multiple crash scenarios around terminal repaint and resize handling.
  * Improve CJK and supplementary-plane text rendering, including wide-character layout.
  * Add input-method support so Chinese IME composition works correctly in the terminal.
  * Rework terminal repaint scheduling and dirty-row caching to reduce UI stalls.
  * Replace the bundled libghostty-vt with a ReleaseFast build and batch PTY delivery
    to significantly improve heavy-output and TUI responsiveness.

